{
  "title": "TinyHouse",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Serum 2 sounds on",
        "the Move: a 3-osc",
        "wavetable, sample",
        "and granular synth.",
        "8 voices, poly or",
        "mono.",
        "",
        "Import your own",
        "Serum 2 presets on",
        "the web remote UI",
        "(preset name >",
        "Import).",
        "",
        "Imported presets",
        "get better by",
        "themselves after",
        "an update.",
        "",
        "Presets, modu-",
        "lation and knob",
        "mapping are",
        "Schwung's own,",
        "from the slot",
        "settings.",
        "",
        "Engine after",
        "Tablor + Wavetable",
        "by Roland Rabien",
        "(FigBug), BSD-3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wavetables",
      "lines": [
        "Imported presets",
        "bring their own",
        "tables. Add more",
        "in UserLibrary/",
        " Wavetables.",
        "",
        "Drop .wav files",
        "there via Move",
        "Manager or the",
        "schwung manager.",
        "",
        "Serum, Vital and",
        "Ableton exports",
        "work. Any frame",
        "size: 2048, 512,",
        "256, 128, or one",
        "single cycle.",
        "",
        "Frame size is read",
        "from the file's",
        "own harmonics, so",
        "short tables play",
        "at the right pitch",
        "with no metadata.",
        "",
        "Pick a table on",
        "the web remote UI",
        "(Osc tab). The",
        "Move's table knobs",
        "list the first 128",
        "tables of the",
        "library, or of the",
        "pack set with WT",
        "Pack."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Stock Schwung UI:",
        "jog scrolls, click",
        "opens, Back goes",
        "up. Knobs 1-8 play",
        "the open page.",
        "",
        "Presets: the list.",
        "Main: cutoff, res,",
        " env, decay, sub,",
        " width, space, bank",
        "Tone: the 3 waves",
        " drawn at their",
        " positions, attack,",
        " release, drive,",
        " high shelf, volume",
        "Macros: each one's",
        " name + a bar",
        "Effects: the chain",
        " EQ WID DLY REV,",
        " then CMP + FX",
        " (master). Filled",
        " when on",
        "Mod FX: CHO FLA",
        " PHA switches,",
        " their mixes below",
        "Voice: mode,",
        " voices, unison",
        " cap, glide, legato,",
        " bend range, volume",
        "Grain 1-3: a sample",
        " slot. Its shape,",
        " the start point and",
        " scan direction,",
        " then the grain",
        " knobs and Kind",
        "Demo: play a song",
        "",
        "Everything else is",
        "on the web remote",
        "UI."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Unison",
      "lines": [
        "Unison goes to 16",
        "on every osc, from",
        "one shared budget",
        "of 64 oscillators.",
        "",
        "Voices divides it:",
        "8 voices share 8",
        "each, 4 share 16.",
        "Mono gets it all.",
        "Stacks shrink to",
        "fit, so lower",
        "Voices for wider",
        "chords.",
        "",
        "UCAP, on the Voice",
        "page, limits every",
        "unison stack live.",
        "Clicking or glitchy?",
        "Turn it down, then",
        "Voices. Up = full.",
        "",
        "Filter Drive adds",
        "warmth and level",
        "and rounds off a",
        "ringing resonance.",
        "",
        "Warps (sync, bend,",
        "FM...) are set on",
        "the web remote UI."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Space + EQ",
      "lines": [
        "The effects a preset",
        "carries: delay,",
        "reverb, width and",
        "EQ. They sit after",
        "the voices.",
        "",
        "SPACE, on the main",
        "page, scales delay",
        "and reverb together.",
        "100 is the preset",
        "as it was made.",
        "",
        "Effects page: the",
        "switches for EQ,",
        "width, delay,",
        "reverb, comp and",
        "the FX bus. DTIM",
        "is the delay time,",
        "RDEC the reverb",
        "decay.",
        "",
        "Every effect has its",
        "full controls on the",
        "FX tab of the web",
        "remote UI."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Modulation",
      "lines": [
        "Imported presets",
        "carry their LFO,",
        "envelope, velocity,",
        "note number and mod",
        "wheel routes, and",
        "their arpeggiator.",
        "",
        "Fine-tune the",
        "envelopes and",
        "filter on the web",
        "remote UI.",
        "",
        "An LFO repeats; an",
        "envelope does not.",
        "A decaying envelope",
        "on the wavetable",
        "position makes a",
        "sound struck rather",
        "than held."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "Notes, velocity,",
        "pitch bend (range",
        "on the Voice page),",
        "mod wheel (CC 1),",
        "sustain (CC 64),",
        "pad pressure",
        "(aftertouch).",
        "",
        "Velocity, pressure,",
        "note number and",
        "the mod wheel",
        "can drive routes",
        "in imported",
        "presets."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Demo",
      "lines": [
        "Play a part of a",
        "MIDI song on this",
        "slot. Bass on one",
        "slot, lead on",
        "another: switch",
        "them on to hear",
        "the whole track.",
        "",
        "Upload MIDI in the",
        "web remote UI:",
        "Demo tab > Import.",
        "",
        "Pages > Demo:",
        "Demo on/off,",
        "pack, part.",
        "",
        "Switching on does",
        "not start the",
        "transport: the part",
        "is ready and joins",
        "at the next bar once",
        "you press Play. It",
        "stops and starts",
        "with the transport.",
        "Parts of a song",
        "stay together.",
        "",
        "The slot remembers",
        "its song and whether",
        "Demo is on, and",
        "comes back to them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Macros",
      "lines": [
        "Every preset has 8",
        "macros (Macros",
        "page). Imported",
        "Serum presets bring",
        "theirs: each knob",
        "moves what the",
        "preset routes to it",
        "(cutoff, effect",
        "mix, wavetable",
        "position...).",
        "",
        "Make your own on",
        "the web remote UI:",
        "right-click a knob",
        "and pick a macro.",
        "One macro can move",
        "many knobs.",
        "",
        "Assigning never",
        "changes the sound.",
        "The first knob stays",
        "where it is and the",
        "macro goes to it.",
        "",
        "Moved a knob by",
        "hand? Press Match",
        "knob on the Macros",
        "tab to bring the",
        "macro back to it.",
        "",
        "Names show on the",
        "Move. A macro with",
        "nothing on it is",
        "hidden.",
        "",
        "The sound at load",
        "is the preset's own;",
        "the knobs move",
        "from there."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Too loud?",
      "lines": [
        "Distorted or",
        "clipping? Turn",
        "Master Gain down:",
        "VOL, the last knob",
        "on the Tone page.",
        "",
        "DRIV adds",
        "saturation after",
        "the gain, so check",
        "it too.",
        "",
        "The slot keeps the",
        "new gain with your",
        "set."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Sound engine after",
        "Wavetable + gin by",
        "Roland Rabien",
        "(BSD-3).",
        "",
        "Filter DSP:",
        "AudioFilter (MZTi).",
        "FLAC: dr_flac.",
        "Pink noise: Thomas",
        "Merchant (MIT).",
        "",
        "Port for Schwung:",
        "athousanddetails.",
        "",
        "TinyHouse and the",
        "Serum 2 importer:",
        "Mathew Taylor",
        "(BSD-3)."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
